s://static7.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/2N/232C/0ETSNU1C80E60CFC0A2FCFpx.jpg","time":"2024-10-01T22:44:07+08:00","caption":"滑雞拼臘腸加芝心雞肉餅","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0MWHy01"},{"full":"https://static6.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/2M/22Q1/0ERD5584710B3AA16EA207px.jpg","time":"2024-09-15T21:20:08+08:00","caption":"#美食日記 #煲仔飯","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0IKbw01"},{"full":"https://static5.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/2M/22Q1/0ERD54AD2FE0F1057E780Bpx.jpg","time":"2024-09-15T21:20:08+08:00","caption":"#香港美食 #煲仔飯","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0I4bw01"},{"full":"https://static6.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/2L/21U5/0EL2HLDF1384ED284CAE6Dpx.jpg","time":"2024-06-08T23:23:45+08:00","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0sSrr01"},{"full":"https://static6.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/2J/20JN/0EBVRXEE3621221228C881px.jpg","time":"2024-06-06T22:59:11+08:00","caption":"呢個飯有好多餸呀，覆蓋細成個飯面！ 買飯嘅時候我睇到餐牌的配料表上面有芝士可以加，就試下睇下有咩效果出來 唔試唔知試過先知，加咗塊芝士之後成個煲仔飯多咗一陣芝士","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0dKDl01"},{"full":"https://static6.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/2J/1ZZL/0E7X39742D52B7631D32A2px.jpg","time":"2024-05-17T16:53:45+08:00","caption":"今次食飯有驚喜喎！我同同事叫左幾個唔同款既share少少！有雞、排骨、潤腸、肉餅，每個款都唔差波，所有既肉都係嫩口嫁！放晏又多1個飯堂可以選擇喇！好野～","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0HN5i01"},{"full":"https://static5.orstatic.com/userphoto2/photo/2G/1XNT/0DRDEGC3D4A6DE24652A13px.jpg","time":"2024-02-08T12:36:17+08:00","caption":"食咗咁多次，到宜家先知原來可以免費加飯底。雞同排骨嘅口感都唔錯，而且保留咗原有的味道，做到「雞有雞味，豬有豬味」的效果。保溫效果非常好，返屋企半個鐘左右仲熱氣騰","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0cAbW01"},{"full":"https://static5.orstatic.com/userphoto2/photo/2F/1WTF/0DLDAS677043D5F627097Fpx.jpg","time":"2023-12-31T22:39:33+08:00","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0b6DS01"},{"full":"https://static8.orstatic.com/userphoto2/photo/2F/1WTF/0DLDAREE24F551B1340592px.jpg","time":"2023-12-31T22:39:33+08:00","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0asDS01"},{"full":"https://static6.orstatic.com/userphoto2/photo/2E/1W3R/0DGAPH3E0DD8A603A72D6Dpx.jpg","time":"2023-12-06T19:46:32+08:00","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0DSTO01"},{"full":"https://static5.orstatic.com/userphoto2/photo/2E/1W3R/0DGAPG7BD111EA8455047Epx.jpg","time":"2023-12-06T19:46:32+08:00","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0DCTO01"},{"full":"https://static8.orstatic.com/userphoto2/photo/2D/1VTY/0DED1F55D04A0B65AE6A55px.jpg","time":"2023-11-26T22:39:35+08:00","caption":"飯焦有九成半，而且飯焦有臘味散發的味道，非常香；d臘腸好好味呀，同榮華嘅臘腸差唔多味；個飯落完豉油之後都唔會好鹹；整體上非常好！！！同傳統砂鍋煮出來嘅味道大同小","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0WsPN01"},{"full":"https://static7.orstatic.com/userphoto2/photo/2D/1VBS/0DARXA16E6719A7228094Cpx.jpg","time":"2023-11-05T23:18:00+08:00","caption":"首先，在煲仔飯方面，飯焦非常多，差唔多成個底都係，飯焦非常之脆口，但又冇粘住d牙，不過最重要都係冇濃底！而個赤蝦米醬有少少辣啦，肉餅嘅size唔會太大亦都唔會太","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0tjXK01"},{"full":"https://static6.orstatic.com/userphoto2/photo/2D/1VBS/0DARX95FFFAD2C5BEB53F8px.jpg","time":"2023-11-05T23:18:00+08:00","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0tTXK01"},{"full":"https://static5.orstatic.com/userphoto2/photo/2D/1V9E/0DAASG0BAD2E98828512B3px.jpg","time":"2023-11-01T13:27:38+08:00","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0889K01"},{"full":"https://static6.orstatic.com/userphoto2/photo/2C/1US3/0D6VVXEA85C30F5C10FB48px.jpg","time":"2023-10-14T21:25:23+08:00","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0xHDI01"},{"full":"https://static5.orstatic.com/userphoto2/photo/2C/1US3/0D6VVW1A3941995D085DA8px.jpg","time":"2023-10-14T21:25:23+08:00","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0x1DI01"},{"full":"https://static8.orstatic.com/userphoto2/photo/2C/1US3/0D6VVV53A8A510B5BE92E9px.jpg","time":"2023-10-14T21:25:23+08:00","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0wnDI01"},{"full":"https://static6.orstatic.com/userphoto2/photo/2C/1UPG/0D6CYP5BB45216DDBB3EF5px.jpg","time":"2023-10-13T22:58:17+08:00","caption":"開蓋嘅時候，聞到超大陣橄欖菜味，以為呢個飯會比橄欖菜覆蓋住其他味，但食落去又唔係呢回事，胡椒同欖菜竟然係咁夾！個飯整體上唔錯！飯焦都幾多（差唔多成個底都係）😋👍","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ08RHH01"},{"full":"https://static5.orstatic.com/userphoto2/photo/2C/1UH0/0